---
// Showdown: Data Race (unsynchronized memory access / concurrent slice append) vs Race Condition (mutex-safe yet nondeterministic).
const W = 900;
const H = 310;
---
<figure class="gcrvc">
  <div class="gcrvc-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparison between a Data Race where two goroutines access or append to shared memory simultaneously causing torn reads and crashes versus a Race Condition where operations are individually locked by a mutex yet interleaving produces wrong logic.">
      {/* Left: Data Race */}
      <rect x="14" y="16" width="426" height="276" rx="10" class="gcrvc-card is-red" />
      <text x="30" y="44" class="gcrvc-h-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Data race (memory corruption)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Data race (đụng độ ghi bộ nhớ)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="30" y="66" class="gcrvc-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Two goroutines touch same address concurrently, ≥1 write</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hai goroutine chạm cùng ô nhớ đồng thời, có ≥1 lệnh ghi</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="82" width="190" height="72" rx="6" class="gcrvc-box" />
      <text x="42" y="106" class="gcrvc-b">Goroutine A</text>
      <text x="42" y="128" class="gcrvc-code">s1 := append(s, 1)</text>
      <text x="42" y="144" class="gcrvc-sm">writes backing[len]</text>

      <rect x="234" y="82" width="190" height="72" rx="6" class="gcrvc-box" />
      <text x="246" y="106" class="gcrvc-b">Goroutine B</text>
      <text x="246" y="128" class="gcrvc-code">s2 := append(s, 2)</text>
      <text x="246" y="144" class="gcrvc-sm-red">writes SAME slot!</text>

      <rect x="30" y="170" width="394" height="104" rx="6" class="gcrvc-box is-red" />
      <text x="44" y="194" class="gcrvc-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Outcome: undefined behavior / lost update</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hậu quả: ghi đè mất dữ liệu hoặc panic map</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="218" class="gcrvc-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Even append on shared slice cap &gt; len races!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Append trên sub-slice chung mảng nền vẫn dính!</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="238" class="gcrvc-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Detected reliably with: go test -race ./...</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Bắt được ngay với cờ: go test -race ./...</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="258" class="gcrvc-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Fix: Mutex, atomic, channel, or full slice cap</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Sửa: Mutex, atomic, channel hoặc s[:len:len]</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right: Race Condition */}
      <rect x="460" y="16" width="426" height="276" rx="10" class="gcrvc-card is-warn" />
      <text x="476" y="44" class="gcrvc-h-warn">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Race condition (data-race-free, yet broken!)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Race condition (sạch data race, logic vẫn sai!)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="476" y="66" class="gcrvc-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Every field access holds a mutex, yet timing decides outcome</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đều có mutex khóa từng bước, nhưng thứ tự chạy làm sai</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="476" y="82" width="190" height="72" rx="6" class="gcrvc-box" />
      <text x="488" y="106" class="gcrvc-b">Goroutine A</text>
      <text x="488" y="128" class="gcrvc-code">go func() {'{'} mu.Lock()</text>
      <text x="488" y="144" class="gcrvc-code">  i++; mu.Unlock() {'}'}()</text>

      <rect x="680" y="82" width="190" height="72" rx="6" class="gcrvc-box" />
      <text x="692" y="106" class="gcrvc-b">Goroutine B</text>
      <text x="692" y="128" class="gcrvc-code">go func() {'{'} mu.Lock()</text>
      <text x="692" y="144" class="gcrvc-code">  i = 2; mu.Unlock() {'}'}()</text>

      <rect x="476" y="170" width="394" height="104" rx="6" class="gcrvc-box is-warn" />
      <text x="490" y="194" class="gcrvc-warn">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Outcome: i is either 2 or 3 depending on scheduling</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hậu quả: i ra 2 hoặc 3 tùy vào thứ tự scheduler</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="218" class="gcrvc-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• go test -race reports ZERO warnings here</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Lệnh go test -race hoàn toàn im lặng ở đây</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="238" class="gcrvc-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Common in check-then-act across separate locks</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Hay gặp khi tách bước đọc và ghi ra 2 lần lock</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="258" class="gcrvc-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Fix: expand critical section or synchronize order</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Sửa: gộp chung vào một vùng lock hoặc xếp thứ tự</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Being data-race-free does not guarantee deterministic behavior. Mutexes prevent concurrent memory corruption (data races), while ordering and coarse critical sections prevent logical race conditions.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Không có data race chưa chắc chương trình đã chạy đúng. Mutex chỉ chặn xung đột ô nhớ (data race), còn việc gộp vùng khóa hoặc đồng bộ thứ tự mới chặn được race condition ở tầng logic.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gcrvc { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gcrvc-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gcrvc svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gcrvc text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gcrvc-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gcrvc-card.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gcrvc-card.is-warn { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .gcrvc-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gcrvc-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .gcrvc-box.is-warn { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .gcrvc-h-red { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gcrvc-h-warn { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .gcrvc-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gcrvc-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gcrvc-warn { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .gcrvc-m { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gcrvc-code { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gcrvc-sm { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gcrvc-sm-red { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gcrvc-pulse-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .gcrvc figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
